me>Lynn</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Charlebois</surname><given-names>ED</given-names></name><name><surname>Lambert</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Lowery</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Perdreau-Remington</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>High prevalence of methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus in Emergency Department skin and soft tissue infections</article-title><source>Ann Emerg Med</source><year>2005</year><volume>45</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>311</fpage><lpage>320</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.annemergmed.2004.10.011</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Frazee BW, Lynn J, Charlebois ED, Lambert L, Lowery D, Perdreau-Remington F. High prevalence of methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus in Emergency Department skin and soft tissue infections. Ann Emerg Med. 2005;45(3):311&#x02013;20. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15726056</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR6"><label>6.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Young</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Harris</surname><given-names>HW</given-names></name><name><surname>Charlebois</surname><given-names>ED</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>An epidemic of methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus soft tissue infections among medically underserved patients</article-title><source>Arch Surg</source><year>2004</year><volume>139</volume><issue>9</issue><fpage>947</fpage><lpage>951</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/archsurg.139.9.947</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Young DM, Harris HW, Charlebois ED, et al. An epidemic of methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus soft tissue infections among medically underserved patients. Arch Surg. 2004;139(9):947&#x02013;51; discussion 951&#x02013;3. <pub-id pub-id-